  "title": "U.S. Navy Has Selected TEGAM Model R1L-E2A for Aircraft and Ship Maintenance",
  "summary": "GENEVA, Ohio–(BUSINESS WIRE)–Advanced Energy's TEGAM, Inc., a leading supplier of test and measurement equipment, is proud to announce that the U.S. Navy has selected the TEGAM Model R1L-E2A Intrinsically Safe Portable Micro-ohmmeter and Bond Meter to fulfill aircraft and ship maintenance requirement of the U.S. Navy and U.S. Marine Corps.",
